      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `72a2060ce44d7c9f3fd7ec221801dc7368aec3b42ed8519a19643f208448c57d--45130_Supplementary-Datacubes-1-14_2005-06.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2005-06\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 15 of 15\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Index\" | 9a17873fe6412795817f118fe2d2bb71a5d3f552b8d26711884f7c00a5d071c8 | missing |\n| \"1\" | 4ff0355ddbe81b63a2c88fc32bd095672e7d7d072ebc7923651918897db56af1 | missing |\n| \"2\" | a8eee16ad48ca63fa4137ab3e6e9c41461fcdf82a7f86fd3fbb38404162e2251 | missing |\n| \"3\" | e13d8419c92e0393566492e915e6956b5ef4e1cbbe8156490fdbbb03a889ad42 | missing |\n| \"4\" | 67eeb6c2a27b9beabc545bcadbbb5156c7a4f0d7900562a94470ce6a459fc0a1 | missing |\n| \"5\" | ad4ccb2dab422e5bea8ad7efa7b99a5c4d6301480355f8d94abb81ebf5a600a9 | missing |\n| \"6\" | 5b81a4cbea5956445fd1299971da8d01e9f120ab0ece2d4c4c374e8b0a43cfdf | missing |\n| \"7\" | 148c9defdd2487c281b0c05741ff7eff0d390d3bad0911c83a7c9d289f3813a8 | missing |\n| \"8\" | 64162046624be5a43c72ea1418d5b2afcb97b83e3b92667dc0aed121466a3ca3 | missing |\n| \"9\" | 1473b78b93e111583bc7e5f04036fff712f1702de94d9f68f8514a1b6525880f | missing |\n| \"10\" | f358d8642b07d8f8ac1d95645fa2bf8a8678cfca0e998e389fbcad08240d9bd2 | missing |\n| \"11\" | d336245c1703db1f5f2fa5a5fe90d0504e1832ccb7fe779b0c8f580ab18f42fd | missing |\n| \"12\" | c658f464bf71fc9e728ce7faa22d304b8d4754bf7474aaa4c9c977c259f4b994 | missing |\n| \"13\" | be2415f13a05636b223e341331de52883427c264c84c4694268c980a673824de | missing |\n| \"14\" | 84f9601a42d7e0ece9896e8c1c4889a5602fdad95041124345fa98212c76265f | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
